  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Comoren 2024 &#x2013; UNICEF Cholera WASH Specialist</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an assignment at the request of UNICEF. In light of the urgent need for enhanced response efforts, UNICEF Comoros seeks immediate support in the form of a WASH specialist with extensive experience in cholera response. The deployment of a qualified WASH specialist is essential to bolstering UNICEF&apos;s capacity to contain the cholera outbreak in Comoros.</narrative>
  </description>
